# Vercel publishes ONLY what the site needs. Everything else in this repo — docs/, sql/, tests/,
# CLAUDE.md, the business plan — stays on GitHub and is never served on nestrel.org.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST: "/*" ignores everything at the top level, and each "!" line lets one thing
# back in. A new top-level file or folder the site needs (an images/ folder, robots.txt, a favicon)
# must be added here, or the live site returns 404 for it. Added 2026-09-27 (security audit, L12).
/*
!index.html
!styles.css
!js
!terms.html
!privacy.html
!vercel.json
